{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Contour Cycling 是一款專注於騎行記錄的單車應用，適合希望專心訓練、不願被社群動態打擾的車友。它把記錄、統計與同步做得簡潔純粹，沒有動態時軸、排行榜與社交壓力。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可直接於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-45.webp\">\n<h2>一鍵記錄騎行數據與統計</h2>\n<p>開啟應用程式即可一鍵以 GPS 記錄騎行，路線、距離、爬升與速度自動保存。內建騎行日誌以地圖、圖表配合相片呈現每次旅程。程式亦整理每週、每月與每年的統計數據，以成就徽章和個人紀錄標示進步，完成的訓練可匯出至 Apple Health。全程沒有動態時軸、排行榜或社交壓力，讓騎行回歸純粹樂趣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-281-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-282-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-283-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-284-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-285-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Contour Cycling</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.781512+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:21:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:58:15.082707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:17.154235+00:00","content_hash":"6e022aac53e461eabc425102f26a72725edb9723fcf5543aabb42ae3c0f4de4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}